{
  "title": "Ultra Gooey Brazilian Cherry Bake",
  "description": "A citrusy and gooey Brazilian dish featuring cherries, perfect for midnight cravings, baked to perfection in a wood-fired Dutch oven. This lacto-vegetarian friendly dessert is sure to satisfy any sweet tooth.",
  "cuisine": "brazilian",
  "diet": [
